{"id":172,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"自由・自主・自立の奈良女子大附属","feature_description":"奈良女子大学附属中等教育学校は、自由で自立した人格と社会的責任の自覚を養うことを掲げ、個性を尊重しつつ学力を伸ばす学校です。奈良女子大学と協働した探究カリキュラムや、生徒主体の学校生活が特徴で、クラブ活動も学業と両立する運営です。社会と世界に開かれた学校像も明示しています。校内の自主活動や研究会も、学びを自分で深める場になっています。研究会や発表の機会も学びを広げます。","clubs":[{"id":3045,"name":"テニス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://nwuss.nara-wu.ac.jp/student/club/club-activity1/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":3046,"name":"サッカー部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://nwuss.nara-wu.ac.jp/student/club/club-activity1/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":3047,"name":"剣道部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://nwuss.nara-wu.ac.jp/student/club/club-activity1/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":3048,"name":"バスケット部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://nwuss.nara-wu.ac.jp/student/club/club-activity1/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":3049,"name":"野球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://nwuss.nara-wu.ac.jp/student/club/club-activity1/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":3050,"name":"バドミントン部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://nwuss.nara-wu.ac.jp/student/club/club-activity1/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":3051,"name":"バレーボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://nwuss.nara-wu.ac.jp/student/club/club-activity1/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":3052,"name":"器楽","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://nwuss.nara-wu.ac.jp/student/club/club-activity1/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":3053,"name":"演劇","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://nwuss.nara-wu.ac.jp/student/club/club-activity1/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":3054,"name":"軽音楽","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://nwuss.nara-wu.ac.jp/student/club/club-activity1/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":3055,"name":"美術","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://nwuss.nara-wu.ac.jp/student/club/club-activity1/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":3056,"name":"クッキング","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://nwuss.nara-wu.ac.jp/student/club/club-activit